HRX_PROFILE_MODE=counters with HRX_PROFILE_COUNTERS=A,B,...: per-dispatch hardware counter samples. Adds the gfx11
GL2C block (L2 / DRAM request counters); TCC and TCP are CDNA-only names.

diff --git a/libhrx/src/libhrx/runtime.c b/libhrx/src/libhrx/runtime.c
